<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="37f00395">&lt;p&gt;
    Using the functional designs,&amp;nbsp;document how to enable them in the selected package application. In other words,
    determine what specific tables,&amp;nbsp;field names, schemas, logic, models, data formats,&amp;nbsp;etc. need to be built or
    used to create the software object. The process to develop technical specifications will depend on the package
    application selected. Additionally, specifications will vary according to the type of component or object it relates to
    (i.e..&amp;nbsp;the creation&amp;nbsp;of a&amp;nbsp;technical specification for a report will have different&amp;nbsp;considerations
    than the creation of a technical specification for an interface). Finally, submit the document for review and approval.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="f8a7101f"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="95d7c0b5">&lt;p&gt;
    Technical specifications are required to be developed for custom development objects. For each development object,
    there are different technical design requirements that are needed to be developed. For cases where custom coding is
    needed, technical specifications may include pseudo code.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Technical specifications are also developed for other technical needs such as setting up the system for the first time,
    configuring connectivity and meeting package security design requirements. Teams should engage with stakeholder&apos;s
    quality review process to review technical specifications and get approval prior to start of development.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="6223400b"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="7720c54f">&lt;p&gt;
    The purpose of the task is to:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Provide specific instructions and details on how to create the package application component
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Provide a technical foundation and sufficient preparation for building the solution components in conformance with
        requirements&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="alternatives" nodeId="efcf6dc8"></attribute>
